menu "crx3 configuration"

config CRX3_START_WEB_INTERFACE
    bool "Start the web interface on boot"
    default n
    help
        When enabled (y), the device serves the classic web control panel at
        http://192.168.4.1 (SPIFFS web UI + captive-portal support for Evil
        Twin).

        When disabled (n, the default), the web UI / SPIFFS are not loaded and
        the device is driven only through the USB serial console. The Wi-Fi
        management AP radio still comes up because the attack engine needs it.

        The web code always stays in the project — this option only gates
        loading it at boot. Set it to y here (or run 'idf.py menuconfig') to
        bring the web interface back.

endmenu
